  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Strengthen Fiscal Policy and Management in Response to the Health and Economic Crisis Caused by COVID 19 in Paraguay II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento de la Poltica y Gestin Fiscal para la Atencin de la Crisis Sanitaria y Econmica Causada por el COVID-19 en Paraguay II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del Programa es fortalecer la eficiencia y eficacia de la poltica pblica y la gestin fiscal en Paraguay para atender la crisis sanitaria y econmica causada por el COVID-19, mediante el diseo e implementacin de medidas de poltica efectivas y fiscalmente responsables.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general goal of the Program is to strenghten the efficiency and efficacy of public policy and fiscal management in Paraguay to support the health and economic crisis caused by COVID-19, through the design and implementation of effective and fiscally responsible policy measures</narrative>
  </description>
